message: "If you use this benchmark harness, please cite the FASTag article and the FASTag software release it accompanies."
title: "fastag-bench: benchmark harness and figures for FASTag 1.9.0"
abstract: >-
  Benchmark harness, result tables and figure scripts of the FASTag article in the Journal of Proteome
  Research, distributed as Supporting Information. The harness version follows the FASTag release it
  describes.
